Usage: berth worktree remove [options] [identifier]

remove a worktree's environment: containers, volumes, networks, images, home,
and registration

Options:
  --domain <domain>              narrow a slug registered under more than one
                                 domain
  --label-namespace <namespace>  supply the Docker label namespace when nothing
                                 on disk records it (a worktree of another
                                 repository)
  --yes                          skip the confirmation phrase
  -h, --help                     display help for command
